  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h3 data-start=\"128\" data-end=\"158\" id=\"isPasted\">• <strong data-start=\"134\" data-end=\"156\">Brand Introduction</strong></h3><p data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"460\"><strong data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"171\"><span style=\"color: rgb(209, 72, 65);\">CASEBANG</span></strong> is a design-led phone case brand reinventing personalization.<br data-start=\"233\" data-end=\"236\">We are the <strong data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"295\"><span style=\"color: rgb(209, 72, 65);\">first to offer swappable magnetic backplates</span></strong>, combining protection, creativity, and fandom. From Pokémon to One Piece, we collaborate with top global IPs to create collectible cases that change with your mood.</p><p data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"532\">Join the CASEBANG Creator Program and turn your influence into income!</p><hr data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"537\"><h3 data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"570\">• <strong data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"568\">Product Description</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"897\"><li data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"649\"><p data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"649\"><strong data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"604\">Modular magnetic phone case</strong> system: change your backplate with a click</p></li><li data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"699\"><p data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"699\">High-quality drop-resistant TPU + PC material</p></li><li data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"795\"><p data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"795\">Dozens of official <strong data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"739\">IP collections</strong>: Pokémon, One Piece, Sanrio, LULU The Piggy, and more</p></li><li data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"835\"><p data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"835\">Includes gift-ready packaging and exclusive limited drops</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"902\"><h3 data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"942\">• <strong data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"940\">USP (Unique Selling Point)</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"1224\"><li data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"1014\"><p data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"1014\">🔄 <strong data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"980\">Swappable magnetic backplate</strong> — change your case in 2 seconds</p></li><li data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1067\"><p data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1067\">🎨 World’s first <em data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1047\">collectible</em> phone case system</p></li><li data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1112\"><p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1112\">🌍 IP licensed: trusted by fans globally</p></li><li data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1168\"><p data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1168\">🔥 Viral on Instagram &amp; TikTok — built for creators</p></li><li data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1224\"><p data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1224\">🛡️ Stylish <em data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1188\">and</em> protective — shock-absorbing core</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1229\"><h3 data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1256\">• <strong data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1254\">Payment Terms</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1530\"><li data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1310\"><p data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1310\">💰 <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1281\">Base commission</strong>: 15% on all referred sales</p></li><li data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1418\"><p data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1340\">🚀 <strong data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1337\">Performance tiers</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1418\"><li data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1372\"><p data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1372\">Silver: 18% (&gt;$500/month)</p></li><li data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1418\"><p data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1418\">Gold: 20% + free samples (&gt;$1000/month)</p></li></ul></li><li data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1476\"><p data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1476\">🎁 Creators may get custom discount codes and samples</p></li><li data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1530\"><p data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1530\">💳 Payments sent via PayPal monthly (or on request)</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1535\"><h3 data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1566\">• <strong data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1564\">Other Information</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1876\"><li data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1593\"><p data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1593\">✅ 30-day cookie window</p></li><li data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1646\"><p data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1646\">✅ Custom affiliate link + optional discount code</p></li><li data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1688\"><p data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1688\">✅ Brand kit &amp; media library available</p></li><li data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1726\"><p data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1726\">✅ Free lifetime access to program</p></li><li data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1771\"><p data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1771\">🛠️ Tracking via UpPromote (Shopify App)</p></li><li data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1876\"><p data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1876\">🎯 Ideal for TikTok, Instagram, YouTube creators focused on lifestyle, gadgets, anime, and KOL collabs</p></li></ul></div></div>",
